# ACPI PCI configuration window regression (tests/headless, acpi-pci-config;
# ACPI-PCI-001): stands in for acpi-backend.svc's launch with the opt-in
# (acpi-pci-config approve-declared) beside (acpi-hardware approve-declared).
# The approved entry must receive PCI segment 0 bus 0's ECAM slice from the
# MCFG, read-only and uncached; the same image started as
# acpi-pci-unapproved.app (hardware approved, PCI configuration not) must
# get the grant without it. "tables" is the firmware snapshot reader, so
# the program finds the MCFG's bus-0 base itself.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.acpi-pci-check"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [
    (Request.Firmware_Snapshot "tables")
    (Request.ACPI_Hardware "hardware")])
